      <Desc>Organize San Diegans to take an active role in demonstrating support for climate solutions and climate justice through education,outreach, and volunteer action. Built coalitions, planned programs, and drew media coverage. Successes included engaging hundreds of core volunteers through 15 volunteer-led teams and mobilizing thousands of San Diegans to take climate action.</Desc>
