        <Desc>Educate and empower Youth to take action in support of climate solutions and climate justice. Organized and held youth climate summits, implemented in-school programs at three Chula Vista schools, organized trainings for youth climate leadership, employed high school and college students in a youth internship program, and led an Eco-Club Coalition.</Desc>
